  "sourceText": "Green Papaya\nBy: Isas bread\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 4:51pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 Green Papaya\n1 cup Bragg Liquid Aminos\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Peel the papaya, chop the way you want, marinate the chop papaya 30 minutes. Done.\n\nAbout\n\n\nThis is a raw food. You can use it in any salad or meal that need some texture on it. Very refreshing recipe.",
